    <result xml:space="preserve">The PI's Conversation&#x000A;An Interactive Fiction by nico ailani carlson&#x000A;Release 1 / Serial number 251007 / Inform 7 v10.1.2 / D&#x000A;&#x000A;Pub&#x000A;The pub is cramped but empty. You are the sole proprietor sitting at the bar though there are a few other patrons milling about in the booths.&#x000A;&#x000A;The barkeep polishes a stein and glowers.&#x000A;&#x000A;In the far corner of the pub is a figure in a trench coat. You think they might be eyeing you.&#x000A;&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
